90
00:07:25,801 --> 00:07:30,801
Access includes interpreters, different
meeting formats and flexible times. Ask

91
00:07:30,802 --> 00:07:35,546
what is workable for the particular
family. Which of these happens reliably

92
00:07:35,547 --> 00:07:40,098
